只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 面板「全局 MCP & Skill」：宿主机 MCP 配置扫描与自动接入、六个 MCP 目录 + 四个 skill 市场、本机收录索引、调用记录","id":"gh:1422100577","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-overall-mcp","slug":"YunzhouLi-hub/dsh-overall-mcp","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 面板「全局 MCP & Skill」：宿主机 MCP 配置扫描与自动接入、六个 MCP 目录 + 四个 skill 市场、本机收录索引、调用记录"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"全局 MCP & Skill"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"=24\">"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Manage MCP servers and Skills in DeepSeek Harness: discover local capabilities, install from sever"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"al marketplaces, and inspect actual usage.** Open **全局 MCP & Skill** below Plugins in the sidebar."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| View | What it provides |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **MCP · Registered** | Scan host MCP configurations, inspect connections, enable, disable, configu"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"re, check, or remove servers. Filter and group by source, with source-wide bulk actions. |\n| **MCP ·"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" Market** | Search, categorize, bookmark, and install deduplicated entries from the official Registr"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"y, Smithery, Docker MCP, GitHub MCP, Awesome Remote, and Awesome List. |\n| **Skill · Registered** | "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"Read `$DSH_HOME/skills`, `~/.agents/skills`, `~/.claude/skills`, and `~/.codex/skills`. Inspect desc"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"riptions, origins, files, and directories, with search, sorting, and an alphabet index. |\n| **Skill "},{"id":"p8s7","text":"· Market** | Browse ClawHub, Anthropic official skills, SkillHub, and GitHub. Use a local index, cat"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"egories, source filters, popularity ranking, and installation. |\n| **MCP · Calls** | Inspect tool re"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"quests, responses, outcomes, latency, and connection failures over the last hour, 24 hours, or 7 day"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"s. |\n| **Skill · Calls** | Inspect tool loads and slash-command references, filter events, fold repe"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"ated references, and page through results. References count with their actual multiplicity; latency "},{"id":"p8s12","text":"averages only measured tool loads. |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Both Registered lists default to 20 entries and offer **20 / 50 / 100** per page. MCP and Skill shar"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"e one navigation row and preserve the selected view type when switching."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Counters and ranking"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Stars and download counts can refresh. Opening or paging measures supported counters for the visib"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"le items, with a five-minute cache for successful measurements. Manual refresh bypasses that cache.\n"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"- Rate limits, network failures, or missing fields retain earlier values with a visible error and me"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"asurement time. Old values are not presented as a successful refresh.\n- Skills default to popularity"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" order. Only SkillHub downloads and Stars receive a **30%** ranking weight; in the all-sources popul"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"arity view, SkillHub entries start at rank **21**. If fewer than 20 other-source entries match, Skil"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"lHub entries remain withheld from that view and can be accessed through the source filter. A SkillHu"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"b-only filter does not reserve those positions, and displayed counters retain their original values."},{"id":"p11s9","text":"\n- Global popularity uses the local index plus measured updates. It does not claim that every market"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"place entry is refreshed simultaneously.\n- The Calls rail includes only resources with actual events"},{"id":"p11s11","text":" **inside the selected time window**. Names, counts, and scope labels agree. Export covers the curre"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"nt filtered results within the host's retained records."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"These images render the current `client/client.js` in the real React runtime using fixed example dat"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"a. They do not contain personal sessions or live marketplace measurements."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### MCP · Registered"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Connection state, source, and actions share a compact list; details open on demand, with page-size c"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"te, source, and actions share a compact list; details open on demand, with page-size controls below."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### MCP · Market"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### MCP · Detail"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Skill · Registered"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Skill · Market"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### MCP · Calls"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Skill · Calls"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Install and update"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Requires **Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`** and DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Replace `<profile>` with your DSH profile name and the directory with your local checkout, then rest"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"art DSH. Update a checkout with `git pull` and a restart. Packages installed through npm can use the"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" panel's self-update action. Updating GitHub code does not publish an npm package."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**The host loads Skills when a session starts.** After adding or removing a Skill, restart DSH and u"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"se a new session. Discovery does not mean a running session has loaded it; Skills have no enable swi"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" new session. Discovery does not mean a running session has loaded it; Skills have no enable switch."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Local index and network access"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Once collected, a Skill index supports local search, categories, sorting, and paging. **Installation"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" still downloads files, and counter refresh still contacts providers.** Refreshing a page does not c"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"rawl the entire market. Use source management to collect the full index again when needed."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The index records received rows, source cursors, sample/full modes, and incomplete coverage. It is a"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" cache, not a live mirror. An October 2026 collection measured 214,747 rows, including 205,037 from "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"SkillHub; those are historical measurements, not today's marketplace totals."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"GitHub authentication is optional. Detect an existing `gh` login or configure a Token in GitHub acce"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ss settings for a larger allowance. GitHub's response determines the actual quota and reset time. So"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"urce failures show a Chinese explanation with expandable original diagnostics."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Data and directories"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Plugin data lives in `$DSH_HOME/overall-mcp/`, defaulting to `~/.dsh/overall-mcp/` when `DSH_HOME` i"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ata lives in `$DSH_HOME/overall-mcp/`, defaulting to `~/.dsh/overall-mcp/` when `DSH_HOME` is unset."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| File or directory | Contents |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `registry.json` | Registered servers, origins, and configuration. |\n| `catalog-cache.json` | Cache"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"d MCP catalogs. |\n| `skills-index.json` | Skill index, source cursors, and coverage notes. |\n| `gith"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ub-auth.json` | Locally saved GitHub credentials, never returned to the panel in plain text. |\n| `ca"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"lls.jsonl` | Bounded call records; reference folding happens on read without rewriting event timesta"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"mps. |\n| `ui-prefs.json` | View preferences such as the reference-folding window. |\n| `events.ndjson"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"` | Operation and source-request diagnostics. |\n| `skills-trash/` | Recovery directory for removed S"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"ation and source-request diagnostics. |\n| `skills-trash/` | Recovery directory for removed Skills. |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The plugin reads existing host MCP configurations without rewriting those files. New Skills go into "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"`$DSH_HOME/skills/<name>/`, with the exact path shown after installation. Removing a Skill moves it "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"into the plugin's recovery directory."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Development and verification"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT. Marketplace entries and their contents retain their respective licenses."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
